{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Illuminate or perish.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step in Illumination of Mansion is dangerous. You wield nothing but a lantern and pure skill to map an haunted mansion tile by tile. The floor plan is a living puzzle; one wrong move awakens the heyulas beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/ad4d696b5ea1136ea9bc0497fcfc1d6b.poster.avif?t=1767810041\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/ad4d696b5ea1136ea9bc0497fcfc1d6b.webm?t=1767810041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.5D-Immersive Minesweeper Puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hallways and chambers as you tackle classic Minesweeper logic mapped\u00a0onto a mansion. Simply throw your cards to reveal tiles, count adjacent heyulas, and clear every shadowed corner. No gadgets, no upgrades... just pure puzzle mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Horror Art!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a richly detailed hand-painted fantasy. Encounter stylized werewolves and\u00a0haunting heyulas against a backdrop of flickering torches. It\u2019s atmospheric mystery,\u00a0not jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/bd073b66d9ce09eebe1d3b9b5dbcbcf9.poster.avif?t=1767810041\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/bd073b66d9ce09eebe1d3b9b5dbcbcf9.webm?t=1767810041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/bd073b66d9ce09eebe1d3b9b5dbcbcf9.mp4?t=1767810041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grid-Based Strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chamber is a carefully designed grid where one mis-step can send you back to\u00a0the entrance. Study your patterns, spot safe zones, and push your deductive skills to\u00a0the limit to illuminate deeper reaches of the mansion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysterious Creatures &amp; Clever Traps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a enigmatic foes, werewolves prowling the corridors, wardens standing\u00a0sentinel, and heyulas hidden beneath tiles. Be careful to vents, projectiles, and\u00a0cracks. Key-finding and Sokoban-style block puzzles add layers of intrigue as you\u00a0reveal the mansion\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/9254db8cac808fc04565d1e8d5f1a2a5.poster.avif?t=1767810041\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799930/extras/9254db8cac808fc04565d1e8d5f1a2a5.webm?t=1767810041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>If you find it easy, wait for it coming more soon.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799930?t=1767810041","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799930?t=1767810041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co